.. rubric:: LCD Backlight LED Blinky by GPIO

See also Zephyr sample: :external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`blinky`.

.. zephyr-app-commands::
   :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
   :build-dir: waveshare_rp2040_lcd_0_96
   :board: waveshare_rp2040_lcd_0_96/rp2040
   :gen-args: -DCONFIG_REGULATOR_GPIO=n
   :west-args: -p
   :goals: flash
   :compact:

